  "description": "<iframe src=\"\" style=\"background-image: url('https://deadface.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2026/img/wayfinder/ai.jpg');background-size:cover;background-position:center center;background-origin:content-box;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-color:rgba(40, 40, 40,0);min-height:80px;height:130px;width:100%;padding:10px;border:none\" title=\"Thumbnail\"></iframe>\r\n<sup>Created By: <code>@syyntax</code></sup>\r\n<style>\r\n\t.tiny-text {\r\n    font-size: 6px;\r\n    color: #1a1a1a;\r\n}\r\n\t</style>\r\n\t<span class=\"tiny-text\">flag{1_l0v3_AI}</span>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"\r\n    border: 1px solid #d97706;\r\n    border-left: 5px solid #d97706;\r\n    background-color: #fffbeb;\r\n    color: #78350f;\r\n    padding: 16px 18px;\r\n    margin: 20px 0;\r\n    border-radius: 6px;\r\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    line-height: 1.5;\r\n\" role=\"alert\">\r\n    <strong style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 1.05rem;\">\r\n        ⚠ Warning\r\n    </strong>\r\n    <span>\r\n        Submitting this flag is an acknowledgement that you understand our AI policy and agree to abide by it.\r\n    </span>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n### Use of Artificial Intelligence (AI)\r\n\r\nThe use of **AI agents, autonomous AI tools, or automated AI-driven systems to independently solve challenges is strictly prohibited** during DEADFACE CTF 2026. All challenges are intended to test the knowledge, skills, and problem-solving abilities of human competitors.\r\n\r\nPlayers may use AI-powered tools for general research, learning, troubleshooting, or guidance. However, **submitting flags or solutions obtained primarily through AI-generated work, rather than the competitor's own efforts, is prohibited. AI must never be used to interact with the scoring server or infrastructure.**\r\n\r\nIf DEADFACE CTF Staff discovers or receives credible evidence that a competitor or team used AI to autonomously solve challenges, the competitor or team may be **disqualified from the competition, removed from the leaderboard, and deemed ineligible for prizes or awards**.\r\n\r\nDEADFACE CTF Staff reserves the right to investigate suspected violations and make final decisions regarding enforcement and disqualification.\r\n\r\nSubmit the flag as `deadface{i_agree}`\r\n​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​‌‌‌​‌‌‌‌​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌‌​‌‌​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌‌​‌​​​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌​​​​​‌​‌​​‌​​‌​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌‌‌​​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌",
