  "view": "<div :class=\"getStyles()\" role=\"document\" x-data=\"Challenge\" x-init=\"id = 96; max_attempts = 100; attempts = 0\">\n  <div class=\"modal-content\">\n    <div class=\"modal-body py-4 px-4 px-sm-5\">\n\n      <div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close float-end\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n\n        <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n          <li class=\"nav-item\">\n            <button class=\"nav-link active\" data-bs-target=\"#challenge\" @click=\"showChallenge()\">\n              Challenge\n            </button>\n          </li>\n\n          \n            \n            <li class=\"nav-item\">\n              <button class=\"nav-link challenge-submissions\" data-bs-target=\"#submissions\" @click=\"showSubmissions()\">\n                \n              </button>\n            </li>\n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n          \n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"tab-content\">\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" id=\"challenge\">\n            <h2 class=\"challenge-name text-center pt-3\">\n              AI Rule\n            </h2>\n            <h3 class=\"challenge-value text-center\">\n              0\n            </h3>\n\n\n            \n              <div class=\"challenge-tags text-center pt-2 pb-3\">\n                \n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">syyntax</span>\n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">ai</span>\n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">policy</span>\n                  \n                \n              </div>\n            \n\n            <small class=\"challenge-attribution text-center text-muted\">\n              <p>@syyntax</p>\n\n            </small>\n\n            <span class=\"challenge-desc\"><iframe src=\"\" style=\"background-image: url('https://deadface.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2026/img/wayfinder/ai.jpg');background-size:cover;background-position:center center;background-origin:content-box;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-color:rgba(40, 40, 40,0);min-height:80px;height:130px;width:100%;padding:10px;border:none\" title=\"Thumbnail\"></iframe>\n<sup>Created By: <code>@syyntax</code></sup>\n<style>\n\t.tiny-text {\n    font-size: 6px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n}\n\t</style>\n\t<span class=\"tiny-text\">flag{1_l0v3_AI}</span>\n<div style=\"\n    border: 1px solid #d97706;\n    border-left: 5px solid #d97706;\n    background-color: #fffbeb;\n    color: #78350f;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n\" role=\"alert\">\n    <strong style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 1.05rem;\">\n        ⚠ Warning\n    </strong>\n    <span>\n        Submitting this flag is an acknowledgement that you understand our AI policy and agree to abide by it.\n    </span>\n</div>\n<h3>Use of Artificial Intelligence (AI)</h3>\n<p>The use of <strong>AI agents, autonomous AI tools, or automated AI-driven systems to independently solve challenges is strictly prohibited</strong> during DEADFACE CTF 2026. All challenges are intended to test the knowledge, skills, and problem-solving abilities of human competitors.</p>\n<p>Players may use AI-powered tools for general research, learning, troubleshooting, or guidance. However, <strong>submitting flags or solutions obtained primarily through AI-generated work, rather than the competitor's own efforts, is prohibited. AI must never be used to interact with the scoring server or infrastructure.</strong></p>\n<p>If DEADFACE CTF Staff discovers or receives credible evidence that a competitor or team used AI to autonomously solve challenges, the competitor or team may be <strong>disqualified from the competition, removed from the leaderboard, and deemed ineligible for prizes or awards</strong>.</p>\n<p>DEADFACE CTF Staff reserves the right to investigate suspected violations and make final decisions regarding enforcement and disqualification.</p>\n<p>Submit the flag as <code>deadface{i_agree}</code>\n​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​‌‌‌​‌‌‌‌​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌‌​‌‌​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌‌​‌​​​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌​​​​​‌​‌​​‌​​‌​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌‌‌​​‌​‌‌‌‌‌​‌</p>\n</span>\n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            <template x-if=\"max_attempts > 0\">\n              <p class=\"text-center\">\n                <span x-text=\"attempts\"></span>/<span x-text=\"max_attempts\"></span> tentatives\n              </p>\n            </template>\n\n            <div class=\"row submit-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-8\">\n                \n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-id\" class=\"challenge-id\" type=\"hidden\"\n                      value=\"96\"\n                  >\n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-input\" class=\"challenge-input form-control\"\n                      type=\"text\" name=\"submission\"\n                      @keyup.enter=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                      placeholder=\"Flag\" x-model=\"submission\"\n                  >\n                \n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-4 mt-3 mt-sm-0 key-submit\">\n                \n                  <button\n                      id=\"challenge-submit\"\n                      class=\"challenge-submit btn btn-outline-secondary w-100 h-100\" type=\"submit\"\n                      @click.debounce.500ms=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                  >\n                    Soumettre\n                  </button>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"row notification-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <template x-if=\"response\">\n                  \n                  <div class=\"alert text-center w-100 mt-3\"\n                      :class=\"{\n                        'alert-success': response.data.status == 'correct',\n                        'alert-info': response.data.status == 'already_solved',\n                        'alert-danger': response.data.status == 'incorrect',\n                        'alert-warning': response.data.status == 'paused',\n                      }\" role=\"alert\"\n                  >\n                    <strong x-text=\"response.data.message\"></strong>\n                    <div x-show=\"(response.data.status == 'correct' || response.data.status == 'already_solved')\">\n                      <div x-show=\"getNextId()\">\n                        <button @click=\"nextChallenge()\" class=\"btn btn-info mt-3\">\n                          Challenge suivant\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                      <div>\n                        <button x-show=\"!share_url\" @click=\"getShareUrl()\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-info mt-3\">\n                          Partager\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"btn-group mt-3\" role=\"group\" x-show=\"share_url\">\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" @click=\"copyShareUrl()\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"Copied!\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-copy\"></i>\n                          </button>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-twitter\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-facebook-f\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'http://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-linkedin-in\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </template>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"submissions\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Submission</th>\n                    <th>Type</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-submission-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"submission in submissions\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td x-data=\"{ truncate: true }\">\n                        <code x-text=\"truncate ? '*'.repeat(submission.provided.length) : submission.provided\"></code>\n                        <button class=\"btn btn-link p-0 pl-1\" @click=\"truncate = !truncate\">\n                          <i :class=\"truncate ? 'fas fa-eye' : 'fas fa-eye-slash'\"></i>\n                        </button>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.type\"></td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solves\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Nom</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-solves-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"solve in solves\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td>\n                        <a :href=\"solve.account_url\" x-text=\"solve.name\"></a>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"solve.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solution\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <div class=\"challenge-solution-content pt-3\">\n                  <template x-if=\"solution\">\n                    <div x-html=\"solution\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">\n                    </div>\n                  </template>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
